    "summary": "# Markdown Briefing\n\n## Massachusetts PRIM Board RFP: Minimum Total Firm AUM\n\n- Under the **Massachusetts PRIM Board’s October 2023 RFP** for **Multi-Asset Credit investment management services**, a respondent must have at least **$10 billion in total firm assets under management**.\n- This threshold applies **as of September 30, 2023**.\n- The RFP also provides an **alternative qualification path**: at least **$2 billion in multi-asset credit strategy assets under management**.\n\n## Direct Answer\n\n**Minimum total firm AUM required:** **$10 billion**"
